# Where "Back to MusterHub" sends a user whose Command session has expired.
# Must be /user specifically -- the bare domain is core's marketing/landing
# page with no login on it at all; core's actual service-code + OTP sign-in
# lives in the Blazor web app at /user. No effect in dev -- SessionExpiredPage
# falls back to http://localhost:5005 there.
VITE_CORE_APP_URL=https://musterhub.app/user
